4:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24 pb-16","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-2","children":"Conversion Diagnostics"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"heading-1 text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Discover Why Your Landing Page Is Not Converting Paid Traffic"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"When paid traffic brings visitors but no sales or leads, the instinct is to rewrite ads or increase campaign budget. Before spending more money on acquisition, diagnose the post-click page mechanics that cause visitors to bounce. This guide walks through 12 measurable root causes - in the order we check them."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=why-not-conv-hero&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-12 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6 md:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-fg mb-4","children":"The Diagnosis Order Matters"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"A failed conversion event is rarely random. Paid visitors leave landing pages due to specific friction points that interrupt their decision sequence. The most common pattern we see is this:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"High Bounce Rate (70%+ within 5 seconds):"}]," ","Indicates message mismatch. The headline fails to confirm the promise made in the ad."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"High Scroll Depth with Low Clicks:"}]," Indicates weak CTA contrast, competing secondary buttons, or missing risk-reducers near the primary action."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Mobile Traffic Abandonment:"}]," Viewport overflow, fixed consent banners obscuring buttons, or tap targets smaller than 44px."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Form Start but Zero Submissions:"}]," Excessive field burden, unclear privacy expectations, or missing inline validation."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Work through the checklist in the order below. Each step isolates one layer of friction. Skip the diagnosis and you risk \"fixing\" the wrong layer - changing headlines when the problem was page speed, or rebuilding a page when the problem was audience targeting."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-fg mb-6","children":"The 12 Checks"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8","children":[["$","div","Message Match Is Broken",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":1}],"$L10"]}]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b"]}]]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]}]
