10:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Message Match Is Broken"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"The ad promised one thing. The page leads with another."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Open your page beside your active ad creative. Does the H1 repeat the same promise, offer, and core terminology? A headline that says \"Transform Your Enterprise Stack\" when the ad promised a \"Free SaaS Pricing Audit\" breaks intent in the first 3 seconds."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Rewrite the H1 to mirror the ad copy exactly - same offer, same words, same outcome. Do this before touching anything else; it is the highest-leverage fix for paid traffic."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"High bounce in the first 5 seconds (70%+)."]}]]}]]}]
11:["$","div","The Above-Fold Area Does Not Answer \"What Is This?\"",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":2}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"The Above-Fold Area Does Not Answer \"What Is This?\""}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"Visitors need clarity in the first 600px of vertical space."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"On a 1366x768 viewport, can a first-time visitor state what the page offers, who it is for, and what to do next - without scrolling? The fold area should contain: a clear headline, a one-sentence value proposition, a single primary CTA, and one proof signal."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"If any of those four elements is missing above the fold, add it. Remove competing secondary CTAs that split attention."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Low scroll depth combined with high exit rate."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
12:["$","div","Trust Signals Are Buried or Missing",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":3}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Trust Signals Are Buried or Missing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"Cold paid traffic does not scroll four screens looking for proof."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Within the 100px surrounding your primary CTA, is there a verifiable proof element: client count, rating, testimonial snippet, security badge, or recognizable logo? If your proof is at the bottom of the page, most paid visitors never see it."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Place one concrete, verifiable proof signal directly adjacent to the CTA - a real number, a named customer, or a rating with a source. Generic \"trusted by\" logo walls without context do not move cold traffic."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"High scroll depth but no click - visitors read but do not believe."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
13:["$","div","Page Speed Is Costing You Conversions",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":4}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Page Speed Is Costing You Conversions"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"Every extra second of load time removes visitors before they see your offer."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Measure the real-world load experience on mobile: Time to First Byte, Largest Contentful Paint, and total page weight. Research consistently shows 3+ second mobile loads lose a majority of visitors."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Compress images to WebP/AVIF, defer non-critical JavaScript, eliminate render-blocking resources, and reduce DOM node count. A target of under 2.5s LCP on mobile is a reasonable starting point."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"High bounce with very low time-on-page."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
14:["$","div","Mobile Experience Is an Afterthought",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":5}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Mobile Experience Is an Afterthought"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"If the page was designed desktop-first, mobile visitors feel it."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Simulate a 375px viewport. Is the CTA visible without scrolling? Are tap targets at least 44px? Does a cookie banner or floating bar cover the button? Is the text legible without zooming?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Fix viewport overflow, enlarge tap targets, move the CTA into the first screen on mobile, and ensure no fixed element overlays the primary action."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Mobile traffic bounces at a much higher rate than desktop."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
15:["$","div","Your CTA Is Ambiguous or Competing",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":6}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Your CTA Is Ambiguous or Competing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"Two CTAs is no CTA."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Count the calls to action on the page. If there are two or more equally weighted buttons - \"Get Started\", \"Learn More\", \"Contact Us\", \"View Pricing\" - visitors cannot tell which action moves them forward. Also check that the CTA button color contrasts against the page background."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Choose one primary action per page. Style it with maximum contrast, keep secondary links subtle text links, and make the CTA label specific to the outcome (\"Get My Free Audit\" beats \"Submit\")."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Low click rate on the primary button despite high engagement."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
16:["$","div","Social Proof Is Vague or Generic",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":7}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Social Proof Is Vague or Generic"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"\"Trusted by 100+ companies\" is not evidence."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Does your proof include specifics - a named logo, a quantified result, a datapoint with a source? Generic claims without verifiable detail actually reduce trust for skeptical paid traffic."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Replace vague claims with one specific, verifiable case: \"We cut client X’s form abandonment from 61% to 34% in 30 days\" with a real page link. One concrete proof outperforms ten generic logos."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Visitors read the full page but never take action."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
17:["$","div","Form Friction Is Killing the Finish",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":8}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Form Friction Is Killing the Finish"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"Every field is a place to leave."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"How many fields does your form require? Are optional fields marked as optional? Is there inline validation or does the visitor find out about errors only after clicking submit? Is privacy communicated near the form?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Cut fields to the minimum needed to qualify the lead - name and email when possible. Add inline validation, communicate privacy in one line under the button, and use a single-column layout."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Form started but never submitted (high field-engagement, zero completion)."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
18:["$","div","Objections Are Never Answered",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":9}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"Objections Are Never Answered"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"The visitor is ready to leave with a question you did not answer."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"List the five biggest objections a skeptical buyer would have about your offer - price, time to result, risk, alternatives, credibility. Is each one answered on the page, or does the page assume the visitor is already convinced?"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Add a compact FAQ block, a risk-reversal statement (refund policy, no-lock-in), or a \"how it works\" section directly above the final CTA."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Repeated visits to the same page with no conversion."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
19:["$","div","You Are Trying to Serve Everyone",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":10}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"You Are Trying to Serve Everyone"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"A page for every visitor is a page for no one."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Does the headline and value proposition target a specific audience, or does it hedge with \"for businesses of all sizes\"? Pages that try to appeal to every segment fail to resonate with any segment."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Pick the highest-value audience segment and make the page speak to them specifically. Use their language, their pain, their outcome. Launch separate pages per segment rather than one diluted page."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Low conversion across a broad audience with strong individual segment feedback."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
1a:["$","div","No Next Step After the Primary Action",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":11}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"No Next Step After the Primary Action"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"The conversion path ends in a dead end."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"What happens after someone clicks the CTA? Does the next page continue the message match? Is there a fallback for visitors who are not ready - a secondary offer, a resource, or a clear exit? A checkout or form page that looks nothing like the landing page can block conversions at the last step."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Extend message match to the entire post-click path. Keep the same headline promise on the next page. Add a low-friction secondary option (download a guide, watch a demo) for non-ready visitors."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"High CTA click rate but very low final conversion - the leak is downstream."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
1b:["$","div","You Diagnosed the Wrong Layer Entirely",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/15 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent","children":12}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"You Diagnosed the Wrong Layer Entirely"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-accent","children":"Sometimes the page is fine and the problem is upstream."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"How to check: "}],"Before rebuilding your page, verify the traffic itself: is the keyword or audience in the ad actually matched to the offer? Is the offer competitive on price? Is the creative promise something the page can deliver? An automated page audit cannot measure ad audience quality or market demand."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"What to fix: "}],"Isolate the layer: run a controlled A/B test with a changed headline against your current page. If conversion does not move with the page change, the bottleneck is upstream in targeting, offer, or price - not the DOM."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Signal this is your problem: "}],"Page scores well on every check but conversions stay flat."]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
1c:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-fg mb-4","children":"When to Audit vs. When to Rebuild"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg mb-2","children":"Audit and Fix"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-xs text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"✓ The offer is clear and competitive"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"✓ The page targets a defined audience"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"✓ The bottleneck is message match, trust, speed, or form friction"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"✓ You want to preserve historical analytics and testing data"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg mb-2","children":"Rebuild"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-xs text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"✕ The offer itself is unclear or the page cannot state it"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"✕ The page tries to serve multiple unrelated audiences"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"✕ The technology stack prevents real performance fixes"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"✕ You have no conversion data to lose"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"In practice, fewer than 20% of landing pages we see need a full rebuild. Most need targeted fixes in message match, trust proximity, and speed. Rebuilds look productive but they reset your measurement history and take 4-6x longer to validate."}]]}]
