2a:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Rebuild only when the page has a structural problem: the offer itself is unclear, the page is trying to serve multiple audiences, or the underlying technology prevents real fixes. If the page has a solid offer but broken message match, weak trust proximity, or slow load times, targeted fixes will outperform a rebuild and preserve your historical data."}]
